  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p>Surrey issues building permits to ensure that construction complies with the BC Building Code as well as the City's own policies and regulations. Information gathered from building permit applications provide insights into demographic changes and development activity. It is also used to calibrate the City's population estimates. Information is available on current building permit activity as well as building permit activity for previous years.</p><p><strong><u>Previous Years Building Permit Summaries:</u></strong></p><p><a style='background-color:#538000; color:white !important; display:inline-block; padding:14px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none;' target='_blank' href='https://cosmos.surrey.ca/geo_ref/Images/OpenDataArchives/OpenDataHubContent/CSV/Archive/BuildingPermitSummary/BuildingPermitSummaries_2026.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>2026 Building Permit Summaries</a></p><p><a style='background-color:#538000; color:white !important; display:inline-block; padding:14px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none;' target='_blank' href='https://cosmos.surrey.ca/geo_ref/Images/OpenDataArchives/OpenDataHubContent/CSV/Archive/BuildingPermitSummary/BuildingPermitSummaries_2025.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>2025 Building Permit Summaries</a></p><p><a style='background-color:#538000; color:white !important; display:inline-block; padding:14px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none;' target='_blank' href='https://cosmos.surrey.ca/geo_ref/Images/OpenDataArchives/OpenDataHubContent/CSV/Archive/BuildingPermitSummary/BuildingPermitSummaries_2024.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>2024 Building Permit Summaries</a></p><p><a style='background-color:#538000; color:white !important; display:inline-block; padding:14px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none;' target='_blank' href='https://cosmos.surrey.ca/geo_ref/Images/OpenDataArchives/OpenDataHubContent/CSV/Archive/BuildingPermitSummary/BuildingPermitSummaries_2023.zip' rel='nofol